      "date": "2026-05-31T05:54:59.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.26 (vs ₹2.09 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.26 (down from ₹2.09 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹18.5m (down 28% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.55m (down 88% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 8.4% (down from 50% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 92% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 72% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
