      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-05-29T09:58:00.000Z",
      "title": "BMB Music and Magnetics Limited Appoints KC Bokadia as Chairman Emeritus, Effective May 30, 2026",
      "body": "BMB Music and Magnetics Limited, at the board meeting held on May 29, 2026 approved the appointment of Mr. KC Bokadia as Chairman Emeritus in an honorary and advisory capacity with effect from May 30, 2026, acknowledging his lifelong contribution to the Company. Brief Profile: Mr. K.C. Bokadia is a legendary and renowned Indian film producer and director with a career spanning over five decades in the Indian Film Industry. He holds the distinct record of producing over 50 Hindi films, many of which became silver and golden jubilee hits. Known for his exceptional visionary leadership, he has been a pioneer in large-scale project management, creative strategy, and public relations. His vast experience in handling complex artistic and commercial ventures brings a unique perspective to the Boa",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5062cc4-fe06-4a8c-a564-8cbcfadf30a7",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-21T17:16:30.000Z",
      "title": "Insufficient new directors",
      "body": "No new directors have joined the board in the last 3 years. The company's board is composed of: No new directors. 1 experienced director. 3 highly experienced directors. Non-Executive Independent Director Deepak Arora was the last director to join the board, commencing their role in 2021. The company’s insufficient board refreshment is considered a risk according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model.",
